{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spookie Dookie</strong> is not just any bathroom simulator. It\u2019s a game about <i>bravery</i>. Namely, <strong>yours</strong>. You saw an abandoned gas station restroom on your road trip and thought, <i>\u201cYeah, that seems fine.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, congrats. Now you\u2019re trapped. It smells like regret, fear, and expired chili. Every creak, every flickering light, every whisper from the stall next door is a reminder: you should\u2019ve held it in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the disturbing secrets of this bathroom, run from things that definitely don\u2019t want you to leave alive. Multiple endings, creepy lore, and enough trauma to make you wish you\u2019d just bought a bottle at the last gas station instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Peak Bathroom Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You as the player are placed into a typical old gas station bathroom needing to take a 'Dookie.' Your job is to finish your business while keeping your 'Spookie' down. Full Spookie means full stop, and that's not a good thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extend your Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 5 nights of the casual bathroom experience with increasing difficulty as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through each post night objectives to unlock more of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/3860070a282777b5a370610e00ab4a3c.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings to uncover what really lies within the walls of this bathroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/ddd9b06b766a0af30bfbc4b5c3ba391e.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ah, A New Arrival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/de85cae46d7c83fbd0aa2308a9cfd00265f6f30c.jpg"},{"name":"Getting Smelly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/d74485922bac67e856f204372baa02a41ebefa5c.jpg"},{"name":"Impressive Size","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/63a7f8dfe36766accdcdaeafb6e10682a3ecb272.jpg"},{"name":"Not Done Yet!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/0a24b2bb15e0c85953544d2eb3e55d743860dfdc.jpg"},{"name":"Plunger Needed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/0d90132e4dcaf2508d30515a48825a7767ef3e4d.jpg"},{"name":"Hired!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/210d8e34773b8be01c5a343646b1e2eb4ed9e7bf.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Normal Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/99ccd7fdb5a6cbb094be749036aa8380b937682d.jpg"},{"name":"Who's There??","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/ae56a626f121d58a6a95815c5a4deeb91bedca7e.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmas Basement Stairs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3967950/88b53badc1850bf83343ebb4fa7e7d3765a91733.jpg"},{"name":"Vent Escape