_tag\" ><strong>The Peak Bathroom Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You as the player are placed into a typical old gas station bathroom needing to take a 'Dookie.' Your job is to finish your business while keeping your 'Spookie' down. Full Spookie means full stop, and that's not a good thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0523bf20882044c2b87bbf272530f9c0.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extend your Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 5 nights of the casual bathroom experience with increasing difficulty as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.poster.avif?t=1760120427\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.webm?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967950/extras/0491d89f7606b176dd818cb6892e9540.mp4?t=1760120427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through each post night objecti